{"seq":3,"slug":"patterns","title":"核心设计模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"event-sourcing-cqrs","title":"Event Sourcing 与 CQRS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/patterns/event-sourcing-cqrs","wordCount":1468,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"outbox-pattern-cdc","title":"Outbox Pattern 与 CDC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/patterns/outbox-pattern-cdc","wordCount":1302,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"saga-choreography","title":"Saga 编排与事件编舞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/patterns/saga-choreography","wordCount":1541,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"核心设计模式\">核心设计模式</h1><p>本章深入事件驱动架构最具实战价值的三大模式组合。Event Sourcing + CQRS 将状态管理从「覆盖式写入」转为「追加式事件流」；Outbox Pattern + CDC 解决了数据库与消息代理之间的 Dual Write 难题；Saga 编舞用事件链协调跨服务的长事务。</p>\n<p>三者不是孤立存在的——Event Sourcing 产生的事件流通过 CDC 传播到下游，Saga 的步骤推进本身就是事件的发布与消费。理解它们的组合关系，是设计生产级 EDA 系统的关键。</p>\n"}